WEBVTT

01:27.985 --> 01:31.025
ADAPTED FROM THE NOVEL "MY QUEEN"
BY XIE LOUNAN

01:38.225 --> 01:39.105
The baby…

01:44.025 --> 01:45.505
How is the baby?

01:50.265 --> 01:53.105
Cangcang, don't worry.

01:54.705 --> 01:56.265
Take good care of yourself.

01:57.385 --> 02:00.425
We'll have another child one day.

02:23.345 --> 02:25.665
I failed to protect him…

02:32.585 --> 02:35.865
It was my fault.
I failed to protect you both.

02:48.865 --> 02:50.145
I don't blame you.

02:52.505 --> 02:53.745
You said…

02:55.585 --> 02:58.425
we'd have another child someday.

03:00.465 --> 03:01.625
As long as…

03:04.065 --> 03:05.265
we…

03:06.985 --> 03:08.425
we're still together,

03:10.745 --> 03:12.385
we'll get through this.

03:16.265 --> 03:17.545
I'm all right.

04:07.145 --> 04:08.105
The Empress is awake.

04:10.665 --> 04:11.505
Good.

04:12.305 --> 04:16.265
She reminded me
that I only have one brother, you.

04:17.225 --> 04:20.504
And that brother once risked his life

04:20.585 --> 04:23.105
to bring me lifesaving
medicine from far away.

04:28.865 --> 04:30.305
So, Your Majesty,

04:31.105 --> 04:34.625
for the sake
of the loyalty I once showed you,

04:36.065 --> 04:37.065
please spare Ying's life.

04:43.345 --> 04:44.265
Rise.

04:44.985 --> 04:46.785
Go to Wuying Hall and pass on my order

04:47.305 --> 04:48.465
and bring Xiao Ying
back to the cold palace.

04:51.225 --> 04:52.385
Thank you, Your Majesty.

05:14.585 --> 05:16.345
Everyone has someone they care about.

05:17.065 --> 05:18.825
I know you care about Xiao Ying.

05:19.425 --> 05:21.945
But indulging her isn't truly loving her.

05:23.665 --> 05:24.585
I understand.

05:27.665 --> 05:30.025
As for this matter,
I won't just let it slide.

05:31.065 --> 05:32.865
Why did Xiao Ying change so suddenly?

05:32.945 --> 05:35.545
Why did she never show any sign before?

05:36.145 --> 05:39.505
I believe none of this is a coincidence.

05:40.145 --> 05:42.185
There must be someone
pulling the strings behind her.

05:44.145 --> 05:45.545
I will get to the bottom of this.

05:46.745 --> 05:48.345
Even if it was my mother who ordered it,

05:48.945 --> 05:50.265
I will not cover for her.

05:50.345 --> 05:51.425
Good.

05:52.225 --> 05:54.065
I expect you to give me an answer.

06:00.425 --> 06:02.905
Ying, what is going on?

06:04.225 --> 06:06.705
Li Hongqing is just a guard commander.

06:06.785 --> 06:09.585
He's not worthy of you. The dead are gone.

06:09.665 --> 06:11.665
Why would you seek revenge for him?

06:12.945 --> 06:15.865
Has someone been filling your head
and leading you astray?

06:17.945 --> 06:20.865
This must all be Xiao Huan again!
It's his plot!

06:23.465 --> 06:24.425
What did you say?

06:24.505 --> 06:25.985
The Empress suffered a grave wound

06:26.585 --> 06:27.945
while saving His Majesty.

06:28.025 --> 06:29.025
And the baby…

06:29.665 --> 06:30.665
could not be saved.

06:37.505 --> 06:38.545
Sir…

06:39.865 --> 06:41.065
Sir!

06:51.785 --> 06:52.625
Your Majesty,

06:53.985 --> 06:54.985
the Imperial Father-in-law is in trouble.

07:09.625 --> 07:12.585
Your Majesty, the Imperial Father-in-law
suddenly collapsed.

07:12.665 --> 07:13.865
How is he now?

07:13.945 --> 07:15.665
He's awake now,

07:15.745 --> 07:17.665
but… not doing well.

07:17.745 --> 07:19.465
Is everyone at Fayun Temple useless?

07:25.425 --> 07:27.905
For now, don't tell the Empress.

07:27.985 --> 07:30.425
Her body can't take any more.

07:30.505 --> 07:31.545
Yes, Your Majesty.

07:32.825 --> 07:34.505
Bring Ling Xuefeng back to the Capital.

07:35.465 --> 07:36.665
Find him the best imperial physician.

07:36.745 --> 07:38.265
Do everything you can to save him.

07:39.145 --> 07:40.945
If anything goes wrong,

07:41.585 --> 07:44.105
at least let father and daughter
see each other one last time.

07:45.905 --> 07:47.185
Yes, Your Majesty.

08:00.625 --> 08:03.665
Qianqing,
what did His Majesty say about this?

08:04.425 --> 08:06.105
Will he have Ying executed?

08:25.905 --> 08:26.825
Ying,

08:28.225 --> 08:29.265
tell me the truth.

08:30.745 --> 08:32.904
Did someone egg you on

08:32.985 --> 08:33.945
to try

08:34.625 --> 08:36.024
to assassinate His Majesty?

08:36.664 --> 08:38.024
You don't need to ask her.

08:38.705 --> 08:40.225
She's still not herself.

08:41.945 --> 08:43.664
I'll have someone send calming soup

08:43.745 --> 08:44.865
so she can get some real rest.

08:49.905 --> 08:50.905
This time,

08:51.865 --> 08:53.105
you were wrong.

08:54.145 --> 08:55.345
When you do something wrong,

08:56.505 --> 08:57.985
there is always a price to pay.

08:59.425 --> 09:00.705
Qianqing, what are you saying?

09:07.945 --> 09:10.465
I wanted to pay that price for you.

09:11.905 --> 09:13.545
But His Majesty is right.

09:15.545 --> 09:16.985
Always indulging you…

09:19.665 --> 09:21.425
is not truly loving you.

09:29.465 --> 09:30.425
Qianqing…

09:32.705 --> 09:34.425
the flower is about to bloom…

09:38.745 --> 09:40.265
The flower is about to bloom…

09:42.225 --> 09:43.865
The flower is about to bloom…

10:07.985 --> 10:09.745
Qianqing, what are you doing?

10:15.905 --> 10:17.265
I've cut her inner channels.

10:18.345 --> 10:20.425
She can never refine poison again.

10:20.985 --> 10:22.745
Qianqing, are you out of your mind?

10:22.825 --> 10:24.065
I'm not!

10:27.265 --> 10:29.225
I was the one running away before.

10:30.025 --> 10:31.625
Ying had a miserable childhood.

10:32.465 --> 10:34.465
No one ever taught her right from wrong.

10:35.425 --> 10:36.545
But in this world,

10:38.025 --> 10:39.865
no one can spoil her forever.

10:42.145 --> 10:43.345
Ying…

10:45.625 --> 10:46.585
forgive me…

10:47.825 --> 10:48.825
forgive your brother.

11:06.905 --> 11:08.385
Qianqing!

11:51.345 --> 11:52.385
Xiao Qianqing!

11:57.505 --> 11:58.705
Ying…

12:01.025 --> 12:01.865
it's all right.

12:02.865 --> 12:04.025
It's all right now.

12:05.025 --> 12:07.545
From now on, you can't make poison.

12:08.825 --> 12:10.905
I'll keep you company in other ways.

12:12.145 --> 12:13.785
I will always…

12:14.665 --> 12:16.305
always stay by your side.

12:18.745 --> 12:20.025
Xiao Qianqing,

12:21.665 --> 12:22.945
tell me,

12:23.625 --> 12:25.785
are you afraid of Wuying Hall now?

12:50.545 --> 12:51.625
Mother,

12:53.545 --> 12:54.665
did you

12:55.865 --> 12:57.545
have anything to do with this?

12:59.905 --> 13:01.185
What did you say?

13:02.265 --> 13:03.865
Did you order Ying

13:06.705 --> 13:07.945
to try to assassinate His Majesty?

13:10.145 --> 13:12.225
Is this how you speak to your mother?

13:12.305 --> 13:14.225
In this palace,

13:14.305 --> 13:16.505
who but you would dare think that way?

13:16.585 --> 13:17.745
Yes!

13:18.905 --> 13:20.545
I wish he would just die right now!

13:26.625 --> 13:29.185
But… do you really think

13:29.905 --> 13:31.145
I would send Ying to do it?

13:33.345 --> 13:35.705
Her mind is not sound.
She is beyond my control.

13:35.785 --> 13:39.825
If anything went wrong,
Xiao Huan would suspect me first!

13:40.665 --> 13:42.705
Why would I set myself on fire?

13:45.105 --> 13:47.145
And if Xiao Huan survived,

13:47.225 --> 13:50.385
I, the whole Liu clan, and you included,

13:50.465 --> 13:51.705
would all be buried with her!

14:02.265 --> 14:05.625
And today,
you question me for Xiao Huan's sake.

14:08.185 --> 14:09.305
Qianqing,

14:10.945 --> 14:12.185
has your heart

14:13.385 --> 14:14.945
already turned to him?

14:20.665 --> 14:22.425
Have you forgotten

14:23.385 --> 14:25.345
the humiliation I suffered back then

14:26.105 --> 14:27.585
and how coldly I was treated?

14:46.825 --> 14:48.585
PRINCE OF YUZHANG'S MANOR

14:51.545 --> 14:52.945
Xiao Qianqing,

14:53.025 --> 14:54.225
I'm back!

14:55.145 --> 14:56.145
Zhong Lin!

14:57.265 --> 14:58.425
I found it!

15:01.825 --> 15:03.545
This method really works?

15:03.625 --> 15:05.065
It has to work.

15:05.145 --> 15:07.185
Though Gold Incense
is colorless and tasteless,

15:07.265 --> 15:09.505
the red flying ants
that grow on dead branches

15:09.585 --> 15:11.785
of thousand-year-old golden nanmu
will swarm straight to it.

15:12.665 --> 15:14.825
They can sniff it out
even from ten zhang away.

15:15.425 --> 15:17.105
I managed to get two of them.
We can give it a try.

15:18.625 --> 15:20.585
You've really helped me a lot this time.

15:21.265 --> 15:23.145
If we can prove my mother is innocent,

15:23.225 --> 15:24.985
I'll make sure
she credits you with great merit.

15:25.065 --> 15:26.745
I'm not doing this for your mother.

15:27.905 --> 15:29.105
I'm doing it for you and Ying,

15:29.985 --> 15:31.185
and for Cangcang.

15:31.905 --> 15:33.145
Her baby is just gone.

15:33.745 --> 15:35.385
Whoever is behind this,

15:35.465 --> 15:36.585
I'll drag them out into the light.

15:43.145 --> 15:45.465
The Emperor just lost his temper.

15:45.545 --> 15:46.745
His anger at you

15:47.345 --> 15:49.305
was just anger at himself.

15:50.345 --> 15:53.265
Once we catch the culprit,
things will work out.

15:57.945 --> 15:59.105
I know.

16:00.265 --> 16:01.585
Besides,

16:02.585 --> 16:04.105
even if he keeps his distance from you,

16:04.185 --> 16:05.145
you still have me.

16:05.665 --> 16:06.865
Right?

16:10.785 --> 16:11.905
Zhong Lin,

16:14.105 --> 16:16.585
if one day I leave this place

16:16.665 --> 16:18.065
and never return,

16:19.105 --> 16:20.425
who would you choose

16:20.945 --> 16:21.945
between Ling Cangcang and me?

16:29.665 --> 16:31.705
If Cangcang is safe and happy,

16:32.385 --> 16:33.465
that's all I wish for.

16:37.185 --> 16:38.305
As for me,

16:39.785 --> 16:41.945
of course I'll go wherever you go.

16:42.025 --> 16:43.265
I go where my man goes!

16:57.825 --> 16:58.865
Your Majesty.

17:03.665 --> 17:04.665
In the future,

17:05.385 --> 17:06.625
Ying can never refine poisons again.

17:08.065 --> 17:10.385
The venomous insect she used this time
is called Dual-Pupil.

17:11.065 --> 17:12.944
It can rapidly draw
out a person's inner power,

17:13.665 --> 17:15.105
but it does severe damage to the mind.

17:17.025 --> 17:18.184
Right now,

17:18.985 --> 17:20.305
Ying only recognizes me.

17:22.385 --> 17:24.265
Whatever I say,
she doesn't really understand.

17:24.865 --> 17:26.305
I can't get any answers out of her.

17:27.145 --> 17:28.424
But on the day she attacked,

17:29.145 --> 17:30.185
her mind was clear.

17:34.145 --> 17:35.425
That's what Dual-Pupil does.

17:36.105 --> 17:37.985
Once it forces out all your potential

17:38.065 --> 17:41.225
and unleashes your power,
you quickly become dull and witless.

17:46.665 --> 17:47.905
Your Majesty,

17:47.985 --> 17:49.985
though my mother raised Ying,

17:50.065 --> 17:53.065
she would never make her
use a secret art that ruins her own body.

17:54.425 --> 17:56.065
If my mother chose to use Ying,

17:56.145 --> 17:57.465
she'd be setting herself on fire.

17:58.065 --> 17:59.105
She's not that foolish.

18:02.585 --> 18:03.665
I truly believe

18:04.265 --> 18:07.145
the one pulling Ying's strings
must be someone else.

18:07.785 --> 18:08.945
I will find them.

18:09.785 --> 18:12.865
But Xiao Ying can't say anything now.
How will you find them?

18:13.905 --> 18:16.425
She finished
breeding this insect long ago.

18:17.465 --> 18:18.945
She even bragged about it to me.

18:19.665 --> 18:21.545
But to get this kind
of insect into the body,

18:22.345 --> 18:25.465
you have to take Gold Incense
for several days in a row.

18:26.785 --> 18:29.665
This stuff is highly addictive.
It's worth a fortune.

18:30.305 --> 18:31.345
It's contraband.

18:33.385 --> 18:35.105
It should never appear

18:35.745 --> 18:36.705
inside the palace.

18:38.465 --> 18:39.625
So you already have a plan?

18:42.665 --> 18:44.105
Within five days,

18:44.185 --> 18:47.425
I will get to the bottom of this
and give you an answer.

19:09.065 --> 19:11.745
UPRIGHT AND HONORABLE

19:33.025 --> 19:34.305
Sir, please don't be angry.

19:40.665 --> 19:43.545
We've been setting this up for so long,
and Xiao Huan is still alive.

19:44.385 --> 19:46.065
On top of that,

19:46.945 --> 19:48.785
I've even lost a grandchild I never met.

19:49.385 --> 19:51.425
How am I supposed to calm down?

19:52.185 --> 19:54.785
But you use this
chance to return to the Capital.

19:55.865 --> 19:57.505
And I've helped you quite a bit.

19:58.265 --> 19:59.985
Now that you're back,

20:01.665 --> 20:02.945
we can finally aim for bigger things.

20:04.425 --> 20:07.225
I've already lost my grandchild.

20:07.305 --> 20:09.145
I just want to go back

20:09.225 --> 20:10.625
and see my daughter.

20:10.705 --> 20:12.065
Are you thinking of backing out?

20:13.265 --> 20:14.265
Don't forget:

20:14.345 --> 20:16.585
the Empress losing her child

20:16.665 --> 20:18.545
was partly your doing.

20:18.625 --> 20:21.865
Do you really think
you still have a way out?

20:33.585 --> 20:35.905
Commander of the Capital Patrol Office,

20:36.825 --> 20:39.105
Zhang Heng, please come out.

20:50.585 --> 20:53.305
I heard you two have never gotten along.

20:53.385 --> 20:56.545
Because of you,
Mr. Zhang was demoted three ranks.

20:57.265 --> 21:00.265
He had to start over as
a lowly clerk in the North City Patrol

21:00.345 --> 21:02.345
before climbing back up to commander.

21:03.225 --> 21:04.985
And even as commander,

21:05.505 --> 21:07.305
he gave you no end of trouble.

21:07.985 --> 21:10.465
Years ago, he stopped your carriage,

21:10.545 --> 21:12.625
saying you were too extravagant

21:12.705 --> 21:13.825
that your carriage exceeded your rank.

21:16.065 --> 21:17.745
If Sir had really wanted
to make things hard for me,

21:17.825 --> 21:20.425
could I have risen safely to commander?

21:23.585 --> 21:25.345
The one playing the game

21:26.785 --> 21:28.905
will sometimes place a hidden piece.

21:30.545 --> 21:32.065
And that hidden piece

21:32.145 --> 21:35.545
often sits at the most critical spot.

21:39.425 --> 21:41.985
Truly, he is a masterful piece.

21:43.185 --> 21:44.065
Right now,

21:44.825 --> 21:47.705
I've turned the key hidden piece

21:47.785 --> 21:49.065
face up for you to see.

21:50.665 --> 21:52.425
Do you still think

21:53.185 --> 21:54.865
I would back down?

22:25.745 --> 22:26.585
General Lu,

22:27.665 --> 22:29.745
let me remind you of one thing:

22:31.665 --> 22:34.665
the Imperial Preceptor
is sacred and untouchable.

22:35.545 --> 22:38.225
The last Imperial Preceptor
had a secret affair

22:38.745 --> 22:41.065
and I personally carried out

22:41.585 --> 22:42.985
her sentence of death by fire.

23:01.785 --> 23:03.785
Inside here are red flying ants.

23:04.585 --> 23:06.705
They love the scent of Gold Incense.

23:07.425 --> 23:09.345
If someone has come into contact with it,

23:09.425 --> 23:11.465
even a dozen days later,

23:11.545 --> 23:13.545
the red flying
ants can still sniff it out.

23:15.025 --> 23:16.305
This register lists everyone

23:16.385 --> 23:18.585
who has entered or
left the cold palace recently.

23:19.385 --> 23:21.065
Once we test them with the ants,

23:21.665 --> 23:23.745
the one behind it all
is sure to be exposed.

23:26.025 --> 23:26.865
COLD PALACE ENTRY LOG

23:26.945 --> 23:28.465
-Wufu.
-Yes.

23:28.545 --> 23:30.425
-Summon Lu Qi.
-Yes.

23:32.065 --> 23:33.105
Wait.

23:36.625 --> 23:39.105
Why isn't Lu Qi's name on this register?

23:40.385 --> 23:41.985
He's Li Hongqing's right-hand man.

23:42.865 --> 23:43.905
That doesn't make sense.

23:45.065 --> 23:46.665
He could've had
contact with Xiao Ying too.

23:47.585 --> 23:49.705
That day, the situation
in Wuying Hall was deadly dangerous.

23:49.785 --> 23:51.945
Yet he showed up late,

23:52.025 --> 23:53.345
saying he'd suddenly taken ill.

23:54.945 --> 23:57.185
How could it be such a coincidence?

23:58.145 --> 23:59.865
Lu's family
has been loyal for generations.

24:00.465 --> 24:02.945
He's an upright man, even a bit stubborn.

24:05.225 --> 24:08.225
It's hard to believe he'd be bought off.

24:09.185 --> 24:10.385
We'll know

24:10.465 --> 24:11.665
as soon as we test him.

24:13.825 --> 24:14.905
Summon Lu Qi!

24:15.585 --> 24:16.505
Yes.

24:25.985 --> 24:28.385
That's roughly what happened
in the cold palace that day.

24:29.665 --> 24:30.865
It was my failure in duty.

24:30.945 --> 24:32.665
I didn't notice anything
unusual about the princess.

24:37.305 --> 24:38.185
It's not your fault.

24:39.345 --> 24:41.345
Any news of Li Hongqing?

24:42.505 --> 24:43.785
None yet.

24:43.865 --> 24:47.145
I've sent more men
to search for Commander Li.

24:47.225 --> 24:49.105
All right. You may go for now.

24:50.145 --> 24:51.185
Yes, Your Majesty.

24:55.825 --> 24:58.425
Put someone on him. Check everyone

24:59.185 --> 25:00.345
he came into contact with.

25:01.825 --> 25:02.865
Yes, Your Majesty.

25:04.105 --> 25:05.025
Your Majesty,

25:05.785 --> 25:07.505
I'll look into this myself.

25:08.185 --> 25:10.625
I want to see who's really behind this,

25:10.705 --> 25:12.145
whether they're man or ghost.

25:58.065 --> 25:58.945
Your Majesty,

26:00.465 --> 26:01.985
is something weighing on your mind?

26:13.865 --> 26:16.025
Here, have a candied fruit.

26:27.425 --> 26:28.745
Your Majesty,

26:28.825 --> 26:31.505
have you found the real culprit

26:31.585 --> 26:32.785
behind the princess?

26:34.745 --> 26:36.065
We have a lead,

26:36.665 --> 26:37.905
but nothing is certain yet.

26:40.025 --> 26:41.025
You said

26:41.985 --> 26:44.545
you would never keep anything from me.

26:51.065 --> 26:52.145
All right.

26:53.225 --> 26:55.625
I promise you I won't hide anything.

26:56.505 --> 26:57.785
But you have to rest

26:58.385 --> 27:00.585
and fully regain your strength.

27:00.665 --> 27:03.545
Otherwise, how can I feel at ease
telling you all these troubles?

27:04.385 --> 27:07.105
I'm almost fully recovered.

27:07.185 --> 27:09.985
Even Physician Li says so.
I can run and jump now.

27:10.065 --> 27:11.745
-See for yourself…
-All right!

27:13.945 --> 27:15.105
I know.

27:15.625 --> 27:18.385
I know you're back on your feet.

27:20.745 --> 27:23.745
Promise me that whatever happens,

27:23.825 --> 27:24.785
we'll face it together.

27:27.065 --> 27:27.905
All right.

27:40.265 --> 27:41.145
General Lu.

27:45.265 --> 27:46.105
Open the gate.

27:57.745 --> 27:58.785
Your Highness.

28:00.425 --> 28:01.305
Open the gate.

28:14.785 --> 28:15.665
Trinkets!

28:15.745 --> 28:17.185
Trinkets! Take a look!

28:17.265 --> 28:19.785
Kites! Have a look!

28:23.065 --> 28:24.265
Take a look!

28:25.185 --> 28:26.025
Mother,

28:26.105 --> 28:27.425
which of these two

28:27.505 --> 28:28.945
looks better?

28:32.825 --> 28:34.145
Wrap them up.

28:34.745 --> 28:35.585
-Got it.
-Ladies.

28:35.665 --> 28:36.425
Take your time and look around.

29:18.345 --> 29:19.745
Sir, another bowl!

29:24.665 --> 29:25.945
Miss, have a look.

29:42.065 --> 29:44.465
How did Zhang Heng,
commander of the Capital Patrol Office,

29:44.545 --> 29:46.225
and Lu Qi, deputy
commander of the Imperial Guards,

29:46.785 --> 29:48.665
end up together like that?

29:53.025 --> 29:55.585
IMPERIAL ASSEMBLY PATROL

29:58.065 --> 29:59.025
LU QI, DEPUTY
COMMANDER OF THE IMPERIAL GUARDS

29:59.105 --> 30:00.105
ZHANG HENG,
COMMANDER OF THE CAPITAL PATROL OFFICE

30:02.985 --> 30:05.505
The Imperial Assembly patrol
was always handled by Li Hongqing.

30:06.305 --> 30:09.465
Now, his fate is unknown
and he still hasn't returned.

30:09.545 --> 30:12.745
So the duty has fallen
to Lu Qi and Zhang Heng.

30:15.505 --> 30:17.705
Someone's plotting
something at the Imperial Assembly?

30:20.865 --> 30:22.865
But who is behind it all?

30:24.665 --> 30:27.945
Lu Qi was the one
who escorted Ling Xuefeng back.

30:29.065 --> 30:31.625
You mean Ling Xuefeng still
won't give up his ambitions?

30:32.625 --> 30:35.505
But Zhang Heng
has always been his sworn enemy.

30:35.585 --> 30:37.865
That's why I trusted him so deeply

30:37.945 --> 30:39.905
and put the Capital's
defenses in his hands.

30:40.505 --> 30:42.705
But thinking about it now,

30:42.785 --> 30:45.145
if Ling Xuefeng
really wanted to block him,

30:45.225 --> 30:48.265
how did Zhang Heng
rise so smoothly to commander?

30:49.905 --> 30:51.505
Could Zhang Heng

30:51.585 --> 30:53.545
have been Ling Xuefeng's
secret piece all along?

30:56.425 --> 30:59.265
So, from Shi Yan's incident,

31:00.105 --> 31:02.905
to Li Hongqing leaving the palace,
to Xiao Ying's attack,

31:02.985 --> 31:05.265
and even Zhang Heng
and Lu Qi colluding now,

31:05.345 --> 31:06.705
it was all within his design.

31:07.465 --> 31:08.945
If this really is Ling Xuefeng's work,

31:09.545 --> 31:11.225
his scheming runs too deep

31:11.305 --> 31:12.145
for anyone to see through.

31:15.825 --> 31:18.225
I'll go arrest
Zhang Heng and Lu Qi right away,

31:18.305 --> 31:20.065
then find a way to call
off the Imperial Assembly.

31:20.145 --> 31:21.105
No need.

31:22.265 --> 31:23.345
I want to see

31:23.945 --> 31:25.945
what he plans to do

31:26.025 --> 31:27.745
at the assembly five days from now.

31:28.705 --> 31:31.145
LINGHE HALL

31:39.865 --> 31:40.825
Your Majesty.

31:41.785 --> 31:43.865
It's so late. Why are you still up?

31:44.465 --> 31:47.305
I just saw Zhong Lin and Luo.

31:47.905 --> 31:49.025
Luo said

31:49.625 --> 31:51.105
you told Zhong Lin to bring him here.

31:52.705 --> 31:55.425
Luo Xianxue helped Hongqing save Shi Yan.

31:55.945 --> 31:58.545
I think he did it all for you.

32:01.185 --> 32:04.665
Calling them into the palace now,
what for?

32:04.745 --> 32:06.545
I want them to protect you.

32:07.665 --> 32:08.865
Since what happened to Hongqing,

32:08.945 --> 32:11.665
there are so few
people in the palace I can trust.

32:11.745 --> 32:16.065
I believe the two of them
would risk their lives to guard you.

32:25.625 --> 32:27.905
Your Majesty, I'm so scared…

32:36.185 --> 32:39.305
He really still hasn't given up?

32:41.585 --> 32:44.065
As long as I'm here, he won't succeed.

32:46.105 --> 32:47.105
What do you plan

32:48.545 --> 32:49.385
to do with him?

32:51.545 --> 32:54.145
Ling Xuefeng's crimes are unforgivable.

32:54.225 --> 32:55.385
I will never spare him.

32:58.425 --> 32:59.585
But rest assured,

33:00.185 --> 33:02.665
the innocent will not be dragged down.

33:57.425 --> 34:00.745
WUYING HALL

34:04.665 --> 34:08.225
WUYING HALL

34:32.225 --> 34:34.025
Everything is ready.

34:34.545 --> 34:36.865
If we fail, we die trying!

35:08.585 --> 35:11.505
All officials of
the Imperial Assembly, enter the hall

35:11.585 --> 35:13.665
and pay respects to His Majesty!

36:28.585 --> 36:29.825
Proceed!

36:30.585 --> 36:32.185
At the dawn of a new year,

36:32.265 --> 36:33.945
all things are made new.

36:34.025 --> 36:36.145
We pray Your Majesty

36:36.745 --> 36:38.145
receive Heaven's blessing

36:38.225 --> 36:40.305
and share in its glory!

36:40.905 --> 36:41.945
Stow your tablets!

36:46.425 --> 36:47.465
Kneel!

36:50.425 --> 36:51.625
All hail!

36:57.345 --> 36:58.865
Long live Your Majesty!

37:02.505 --> 37:03.465
You may all rise!

37:06.825 --> 37:07.785
Present your tablets!

37:12.425 --> 37:13.665
By Your Majesty's grace,

37:14.545 --> 37:18.545
in the ninth year of
Yongxi, Great Qi is rich and strong.

37:19.145 --> 37:22.385
In the southern provinces,
the land is fertile and the waters full.

37:22.465 --> 37:25.065
Though we faced locust plague,
the damage was slight.

37:25.665 --> 37:26.945
Every home has grain stored.

37:27.025 --> 37:28.745
The people are all well fed.

37:28.825 --> 37:31.625
At best, fields yield
two dan of grain per mu.

37:32.145 --> 37:33.545
As for the remaining details,

37:33.625 --> 37:35.145
I've set them out in full

37:35.225 --> 37:36.985
for Your Majesty's review.

37:43.345 --> 37:45.545
Such prosperity
is thanks to all you ministers.

37:46.145 --> 37:48.585
What Great Qi seeks
is not short-term gain.

37:49.385 --> 37:51.065
I hope you will all work as one,

37:51.665 --> 37:53.425
abolish outdated rules,
and push forward new policies.

37:53.505 --> 37:55.225
Let the brave know righteousness,

37:55.305 --> 37:56.505
and the wise cherish benevolence.

37:58.145 --> 38:00.865
We will heed your teachings!

38:57.065 --> 38:59.625
Imperial Preceptor Du
has prepared Tusu wine for everyone.

38:59.705 --> 39:01.465
Let's all raise a toast

39:01.545 --> 39:03.985
to Great Qi's future,
with fair winds and timely rain,

39:04.065 --> 39:06.585
and a peaceful, prosperous people!

39:11.745 --> 39:12.705
How could this cup of wine

39:13.305 --> 39:17.145
possibly go without me?

39:51.985 --> 39:53.025
Ling Xuefeng,

39:54.025 --> 39:54.945
you dare commit treason!

40:00.585 --> 40:03.225
So you've been
planning this for a long time, Sir.

40:03.825 --> 40:05.025
Since you've come today,

40:05.105 --> 40:07.785
I'm sure you have plenty to say.

40:09.465 --> 40:10.905
Of course.

40:11.665 --> 40:14.905
Today I came to ask just one thing:

40:15.505 --> 40:19.305
Without the full support
of the Ling clan and me,

40:19.385 --> 40:23.105
what right or ability did you have
to sit securely on the throne?

40:24.105 --> 40:26.905
So, you want to take it for yourself?

40:27.585 --> 40:30.625
I have no wish to usurp you.

40:30.705 --> 40:34.745
But I have already
received an imperial edict.

40:34.825 --> 40:37.185
It states His Majesty is
gravely ill with a cold illness,

40:37.905 --> 40:43.185
and thus he has passed the throne to
the prince in the Empress's womb.

40:43.265 --> 40:45.465
He orders me to bear the imperial seal,

40:45.545 --> 40:48.425
ascend to the Taiji Hall,
assist the new emperor,

40:49.025 --> 40:51.825
share in handling state affairs,
and oversee the realm and armies.

40:52.425 --> 40:54.705
This minister dares not refuse.

40:56.945 --> 40:59.585
Why didn't I know about this edict?

41:00.625 --> 41:04.505
Because… during today's court session,

41:04.585 --> 41:08.625
you will suddenly be taken ill and die.

41:28.905 --> 41:31.825
You're that sure
everything will go your way today?

41:33.825 --> 41:36.185
The hearts of men are with me.

41:53.625 --> 41:54.625
Good.

41:55.505 --> 41:56.545
Very good.

42:27.985 --> 42:30.505
So, you'd planned ahead all along.

42:31.185 --> 42:32.345
I've already spent the night

42:32.425 --> 42:34.465
replacing the Imperial Guards
with my own men.

42:35.305 --> 42:38.585
In fact, I could've taken down
the Capital Patrol commander earlier.

42:39.185 --> 42:42.305
But… I wanted to see

42:42.905 --> 42:48.105
just how many people in this court
truly stand on your side.

42:59.865 --> 43:03.025
Now that you've seen it for yourself,

43:03.865 --> 43:07.865
allow me to send Your Majesty on your way.
